DECISIONS 339, CODEGEN.md §2.1: an enum listed twice in `open` is `openTwice`, at the later name.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A destination.
enum Dst { str, sta }

emit go { out: "@sovcommon/a", mode: types, open: [Dst, Dst] }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8009]  a/a.canon:6:57
  open of emit go: Dst is listed twice

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
